<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προάρχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>begin first,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδικεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.9.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδικίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phalar.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					147
				</span></i>
			: —
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					344
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hold office before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προάρξαντες αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					57.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλην ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					76.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ταμίας ὁ προάρχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.303.38
				</span></i>
			 (Orop.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be previous governor,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Μακεδονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					47.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be chief</i> or <i>eponymous archon of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐν [Δελ]φοῖς τὴν
			ἐν[ναετηρίδα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
				17.14
			</span></i>.</div>
